---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1>The Archives ✦</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm working on an English fan translation of this Japan-only DS game.
        A lot of that work involves pulling the game open and finding what's
        inside — files, art, dialog, characters. This is where the pieces I
        uncover end up, so I can come back to them and so anyone else who's
        curious can poke around.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-decoration" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="hero-sprite hp-center" src={`${base}/decorations/magic-lamp-crystal.png`} alt="" />
      <img class="hero-sprite hp1" src={`${base}/decorations/butterfly-yellow.png`} alt="" />
      <img class="hero-sprite hp2" src={`${base}/decorations/crown.png`} alt="" />
      <img class="hero-sprite hp3" src={`${base}/decorations/key.png`} alt="" />
      <img class="hero-sprite hp4" src={`${base}/decorations/grapes.png`} alt="" />
      <img class="hero-sprite hp5" src={`${base}/decorations/dragonfly.png`} alt="" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="section-divider" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src={`${base}/decorations/peach.png`} alt="" />
    <img src={`${base}/decorations/parfait.png`} alt="" />
    <img src={`${base}/decorations/lemon.png`} alt="" />
  </div>

  <section class="sections">
    <div class="section-grid">
      <a href={`${base}/patches/`} class="section-card live">
        <span class="section-emoji">💾</span>
        <h3>Patches</h3>
        <p>Download the latest English patch for the ROM. Release history, MD5 hashes, and instructions for applying the patch with Delta Patcher.</p>
        <span class="section-cta">Latest release →</span>
      </a>
      <a href={`${base}/assets/`} class="section-card live">
        <span class="section-emoji">🖼️</span>
        <h3>2D Assets</h3>
        <p>Item icons, NPC sprites, magic keyboard glyphs, shop screens, title art — every 2D image in the game, with palette and source-container metadata.</p>
        <span class="section-cta">Browse →</span>
      </a>
      <a href={`${base}/field-guide/`} class="section-card live">
        <span class="section-emoji">📖</span>
        <h3>Field Guide</h3>
        <p>What I've found inside the game — how the files are laid out, how the dialog system works, where the art lives, and the translation canon I'm working from.</p>
        <span class="section-cta">Read →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 60px 0 40px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .hero-decoration {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle at center,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) 0%,
      rgba(255, 213, 232, 0.7) 45%,
      rgba(202, 179, 255, 0.4) 70%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .hero-sprite {
    position: absolute;
    image-rendering: auto;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
  }

  .hp-center {
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 168px;
    height: 168px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    opacity: 0.95;
  }

  .hp1 { top: 8%; left: 14%; width: 72px; height: 72px; opacity: 0.85; transform: rotate(-8deg); }
  .hp2 { top: 14%; right: 12%; width: 84px; height: 84px; opacity: 0.9; transform: rotate(6deg); }
  .hp3 { bottom: 16%; left: 8%; width: 76px; height: 76px; opacity: 0.8; transform: rotate(-4deg); }
  .hp4 { bottom: 8%; right: 14%; width: 80px; height: 80px; opacity: 0.85; transform: rotate(10deg); }
  .hp5 { top: 46%; right: 4%; width: 64px; height: 64px; opacity: 0.7; transform: rotate(-12deg); }

  .section-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 8px 0 4px;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .section-divider img {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    image-rendering: auto;
  }

  .section-divider img:nth-child(2) {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
  }

  .sections {
    padding: 30px 0 50px;
  }

  .section-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .section-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--surface-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-pink-100);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .section-card.live {
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .section-card.live:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-pop);
    border-color: var(--color-pink-200);
  }

  .section-card.more {
    opacity: 0.72;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .section-emoji {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .section-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .section-cta {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-pink-600);
  }
</style>
